2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0<strong>TRUE ROMAN\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/givechance.gif?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/features4.png?t=1745433519\" /><i>\u00a0</i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0<strong>FEATURES ROMANUM\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THOUSANDS OF LINES OF DIALOGUE AND WRITING -\u00a0</strong>SHAPING A UNQUE AND EVOCATIVE STORY<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HOURS OF RECORDED SFX AND SOUNDTRACKS -\u00a0</strong>COMPOSED WITH ANCIENT AND MODERN INSTRUMENTS LIVE AND SYNTHESIZED</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEEP RPG MECHANICS AND SYSTEMS -\u00a0</strong>REWARDING PLAYERS AND ENRICHING THEIR EXPERIENCE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUNDREDS OF DIGITAL ART ASSETS -\u00a0</strong>DEVELOPED WITH MODERN TOOLS TO CREATE INCREDIBLE VISUALS BASED ON RENAISSANCE AND HISTORICAL ARTISTS LONG DECEASED</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EPIC BRANCHING STORY -\u00a0</strong>RIFE WITH CONSEQUENCES AND IMPACTFUL CHOICES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/fastclips.gif?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" /><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/worldtab.png?t=1745433519\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0<strong>HISTORICAL GAME\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ANCIENT ROME WAS A WORLD OF GREATNESS AND LIVELINESS - IN SO MANY WAYS THE PRECURSOR  TO OUR OWN <br>YET THE WEAVING OF GODS AND MORTALS,  MYTH AND REALITY WERE OFTEN BLURRED  <br><strong>TRUE ROMAN</strong> BRINGS THIS CHERISHED ERA TO LIFE <br>FROM THE BUSTLING STREETS OF THE GREAT CITY TO THE GREAT LANDSCAPES OF THE COUNTRYSIDE  <br>EVERY MOMENT IS STEEPED IN THE CULTURE, BELIEFS, AND STRUGGLES OF THE TIME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THIS IS NOT  A RETELLING OF ROME\u2014IT IS A JOURNEY THROUGH ITS VERY SOUL \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/doocrlip.gif?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/trmystery.png?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0<strong>INSCRIPTION\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The augurs read the sky, but the omens are all wrong. Birds move in twisting patterns that shouldn\u2019t exist, casting shadows where no light should fall. I long to trace the lines in the dust, find a purer meaning, but these cursed shapes shift every time I blink.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gods whisper everywhere, but not  words. Flickers of sanguine torchlight, immense weights of unseen penetrating eyes, a name I do not remember knowing.. WHO CARVES THIS PATH!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sibyls once dined on speeches at the junctions of the Via Appia, but no roads remain here, only the faint and dappled echoes of feet that once did tread.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Reach forward will you? Steady yourself it's going to happen again, the beginning of all the endings the part where the world tilts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Somewhere, somewhere else, the something reaches back...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eagler.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0I II III IV V VI VII VIII IX X XI XII XIII XIV XV XVI XVII XVIII XIX XX XXI XXII XXIII XXIV XXV\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglel.png?t=1745433519\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484780?t=1745433519","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/0e1b08e4ce864da0add66eb22c26a0b132fdc2bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745433519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/8590e0392f71f6749506d0dd46cbb4e398a249a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745433519","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/8590e0392f71f6749506d0dd46cbb4e398a249a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745433519","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game depicts the complexities of life in the ancient world. It does not shy away from the realities of Roman society and includes some brutality, decadence, and moral contradictions. Players will encounter mature themes such as violence, exploitation, substance use as well as moments of psychological tension and horror.\r\n\r\nWhile dramatised, these elements reflect the world as it was, different but deeply human. Player discretion is advised if sensitive to any of these themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eagler.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0I II III IV V VI VII VIII IX X XI XII XIII XIV XV XVI XVII XVIII XIX XX XXI XXII XXIII XXIV XXV\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglel.png?t=1745433519\" />\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u25