g> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/worldtab.png?t=1745433519\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0<strong>HISTORICAL GAME\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ANCIENT ROME WAS A WORLD OF GREATNESS AND LIVELINESS - IN SO MANY WAYS THE PRECURSOR  TO OUR OWN <br>YET THE WEAVING OF GODS AND MORTALS,  MYTH AND REALITY WERE OFTEN BLURRED  <br><strong>TRUE ROMAN</strong> BRINGS THIS CHERISHED ERA TO LIFE <br>FROM THE BUSTLING STREETS OF THE GREAT CITY TO THE GREAT LANDSCAPES OF THE COUNTRYSIDE  <br>EVERY MOMENT IS STEEPED IN THE CULTURE, BELIEFS, AND STRUGGLES OF THE TIME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THIS IS NOT  A RETELLING OF ROME\u2014IT IS A JOURNEY THROUGH ITS VERY SOUL \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/doocrlip.gif?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/top.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/trmystery.png?t=1745433519\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0<strong>INSCRIPTION\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglefwd.png?t=1745433519\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The augurs read the sky, but the omens are all wrong. Birds move in twisting patterns that shouldn\u2019t exist, casting shadows where no light should fall. I long to trace the lines in the dust, find a purer meaning, but these cursed shapes shift every time I blink.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gods whisper everywhere, but not  words. Flickers of sanguine torchlight, immense weights of unseen penetrating eyes, a name I do not remember knowing.. WHO CARVES THIS PATH!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sibyls once dined on speeches at the junctions of the Via Appia, but no roads remain here, only the faint and dappled echoes of feet that once did tread.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Reach forward will you? Steady yourself it's going to happen again, the beginning of all the endings the part where the world tilts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Somewhere, somewhere else, the something reaches back...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eagler.png?t=1745433519\" />\u00a0I II III IV V VI VII VIII IX X XI XII XIII XIV XV XVI XVII XVIII XIX XX XXI XXII XXIII XXIV XXV\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/extras/eaglel.png?t=1745433519\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</p>","developers":["Phantom Axis Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484780/c0d23a0714bd090d6ba1651583120a3aac431afb/header.jpg?t=1745433519","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"True Roman is a work of fiction all characters and events depicted in this game and associated materials have no relation to real life persons nor specific events. Any exceptions are long dead historical figures and are named as such.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any modern Linux distribution (e.g., Ubuntu, Fedora, Arch)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz dual-core processor or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics should be fine (Intel HD Graphics, AMD, etc.)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or newer (other distros shoul